   "status": "MISMATCH",
   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; i1040s8812 p. 9, Additional Medicare Tax and RRTA Tax Worksheet, line 16: \"Add lines 6, 7, 11, and 15. Enter here and on line 21 of Schedule 8812 and, if applicable, line 7 of Credit Limit Worksheet B\". Lines 11 and 15 are the Tier 1 RRTA amounts, outside the slice: person.rrta refuses the per-person Medicare totals that Form 8959 line 19 sums, and the Form 8959 lines refuse on f8959.unsupported (RRTA compensation), so a return with RRTA compensation refuses before this line. The rendered line cannot show that upstream refusal. Re-checked this round: person.se_screen still names \"electing an optional method (Schedule SE Part II)\", and BUG-0401 changed only s8812.from_part_iia and s8812.part_iib_result (the combat-pay gate read through s8812.show_iia), not these lines. Project stands on the English.",
